        "id": 179305,
        "name": "Trajector",
        "username": "Trajector",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-07-26T14:19:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Three comments:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Thank you thank you THANK you for that Provacator Tarnis ruling!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Finally an answer to the enduring Jack Crowbars situation! Though, for some reason, I had not thought about Quadruple Crowbars before - thanks for putting that combo into my head, though I find it odd that it deals three instances of damage instead of four.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>One of the Guise clarifications says something about that “he cannot can he” do something. Was that a question? <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
