        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-07-26T17:46:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Informant and Trueshot should work the same way as before.</p><p>We'll revisit that one with respect to \"put into play\", I think something might have been missed there in the discussion.</p><p>I can't give clarifications about cards we haven't discussed with Christopher yet.</p>",
