      {
        "id": 179309,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-07-27T02:07:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If Guise has someone else's card in his hand – a Link, a Golem, Tool Box – and an effect requires him to discard, does discarding that other hero's card satisfy Guise's discard, the other hero's, both? Neither?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well, I tried this out in digital today. The answer is, Tool Box counts for Guise and goes into Guise's trash! (Fixer can get it back with Salvage Yard, of course.)</p>",
